{
  "name": "maxrim",
  "description": "MaxRIM is an AI-assisted research intelligence and management platform for healthcare researchers, providing project-scoped PDF ingestion, evidence retrieval, and citation-verified report generation in one auditable workflow. It also supports systematic-review tasks such as deduplication, AI-assisted screening, data extraction, and export. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
